{#
  "Create guidance" on the unified hub — v6's own port of v2's
  create-guidance.html, adapted with a back link to the hub (task-
  specified) instead of a breadcrumb, and a real "must select one option"
  validation v2's own version never had (its POST handler silently
  defaults an empty submission to "upload" — this one doesn't). See
  controller.js's own top comment and the plan this was built from for
  the rest of what differs from v2.

  Validation follows the same govukErrorSummary pattern already
  established in this codebase for a real server-side check
  (app/views/versions/v4/upload-metadata.html + its POST handler,
  legacy/routes.js — frozen but a proven, working reference): errors.
  <field> = { text, href }, errorList: Object.values(errors), the same
  template re-rendered with the submission preserved on failure, "Error: "
  prefixed onto pageName so an assistive-tech user's tab title reflects
  it too. novalidate on the form so the server-side check is what
  actually runs, not a browser-native "required" popup nothing else on
  this page uses either.

  "Create a new guide"/"Update existing guide" have no real destination
  yet (placeholder, per the task) — selecting either and clicking
  Continue re-renders this same page with that choice still selected, not
  a redirect and not an error (see controller.js's post).
#}
{% extends "common/layouts/content.njk" %}

{% from "govuk/components/radios/macro.njk" import govukRadios %}
{% from "govuk/components/button/macro.njk" import govukButton %}
{% from "govuk/components/error-summary/macro.njk" import govukErrorSummary %}

{% set pageName = "What would you like to do?" %}
{% if errorList and errorList.length %}{% set pageName = "Error: " + pageName %}{% endif %}

{% block columns %}

  {% if errorList and errorList.length %}
    {{ govukErrorSummary({ titleText: "There is a problem", errorList: errorList }) }}
  {% endif %}

  <form method="post" action="/v6/create-guidance" novalidate>

    {{ govukRadios({
      idPrefix: "create-guidance",
      name: "createGuidance",
      value: selected,
      fieldset: {
        legend: {
          text: "What would you like to do?",
          isPageHeading: true,
          classes: "govuk-fieldset__legend--l"
        }
      },
      errorMessage: errors.createGuidance,
      items: [
        {
          value: "upload",
          text: "Upload guidance",
          hint: { text: "Upload a Word document and convert it to Markdown. You can then review, edit and publish it." }
        },
        {
          value: "create-new",
          text: "Create a new guide",
          hint: { text: "Start a new guidance" }
        },
        {
          value: "update-existing",
          text: "Update existing guide",
          hint: { text: "Make changes to guidance that's already been published" }
        }
      ]
    }) }}

    {{ govukButton({ text: "Continue" }) }}

  </form>

{% endblock %}
